<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Treasury to release Feb results at 1800 GMT.</title>
<headline>Brazil Treasury to release Feb results at 1800 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Treasury will release February budget results at 1500 local/1800 GMT on Monday, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>In January, the Treasury posted a $1.263 billion reais operating budget deficit, which includes interest payments. Also in January, it reported a $304 million deficit in its primary accounts, which exclude interest payments.</p>
<p>--John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248-5414</p>
